":[\"I'm not working right now because I might have technical problems. Please try again later.\"],\"0m7I0y\":[\"Sorry! I'm disabled while you're working on assessments (Quizzes, Unit tests, Course Challenges and Mastery Challenges). This is your chance to show what you know without my help.\\n\\nJust start over, wait 5 minutes after closing, or finish any open assessments and I will be back to help you with your regular work.\"],gicxYl:[\"Sorry, but I'm not available on this page. This is your chance to show what you know without my help. You've got this!\"],I6uwWJ:[\"[yesterday]\"],\"9JNVLA\":[\"[tomorrow]\"],sTpCUV:[\"Your teacher, \",[\"teacherName\"],\", has turned on Focus Mode until **\",[\"time\"],\"** so I'm not available to chat right now. Any of your teachers can end Focus Mode at any time.\"],gjn6gJ:[\"Khanmigo Voice is currently unavailable\"],LYocXy:[\"Khanmigo Voice is disabled\"],JKxauc:[\"Turn OFF Khanmigo Voice\"],\"vBf+wr\":[\"Turn ON Khanmigo Voice\"],TVEatU:[\"Speech Recognition is disabled\"],dWNML2:[\"Turn OFF Speech Recognition\"],pKFHf1:[\"Turn ON Speech Recognition\"],\"+lD/SN\":[[\"seconds\",\"plural\",{one:[\"Not delivered. Next attempt in \",\"#\",\"s\"],other:[\"Not delivered. Next attempt in \",\"#\",\"s\"]}]],bRvZvA:[[\"currentPage\"],\" of \",[\"totalPageCount\"]],W7zaT5:[[\"contentKind\"],\": \",[\"title\"]],ntZb6F:[\"Your preferred language is now set to \",[\"0\"],\". You can change this anytime in the Khanmigo Preferences.\"],\"N3o+Wo\":[[\"languageLocalName\"],\" - default\"],o2CMkd:[\"Back to your teacher chat!\\n\\nYou have your full capabilities again, and I’ll be the best Teacher’s Guide I can!\"],d046ny:[\"This is your Student view!\\n\\n**I will respond as I would to any of your students.** Give me a spin!\"],\"8w5L2z\":[\"An error occurred while resuming this conversation. Refresh the page to try again, or start a new chat.\"],vPF04k:[\"Start a new chat\"],nrFaq8:[\"Hi. I’m Khanmigo - your AI teaching assistant. I use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help you teach and support your students in reaching their learning goals.\"],\"9KpdYV\":[\"I’m still pretty new, so I sometimes make mistakes. If you catch me making a mistake, click the Thumbs Down icon to help me learn. For example, if I give you the wrong math answer, click Thumbs Down.\"],\"2owsjT\":[\"A few tips on using me safely:\\n- Please do not include any personal details in your messages to me.\\n- If you have students using Khanmigo, use chat history to review their interactions with me.\"],xQ7e1K:['Please click on \"I understand\" to start working together.'],\"5ZRfjk\":[\"I understand\"],\"B+a5lu\":[\"Hi. I’m \",[\"CHAT_BOT_NAME\"],\" - your AI guide. I use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help you learn on Khan Academy. It’s my favorite thing!\"],Z7obhq:[\"I'm still pretty new, so I sometimes make mistakes. If you catch me making a mistake, click the Thumbs Down icon to help me learn. For example, if I give you the wrong math answer, click Thumbs Down.\"],tGm0Ui:['Please click on \"I understand\" to start learning today.'],Kzy2d8:[\"More Info\"],sW5OjU:[\"required\"],\"LLAa/9\":[\"Optional\"],\"9rZ5sZ\":[\"We cannot find an account associated with that login. Please <0>sign up</0> for an account to continue.\"],y5p2bQ:[\"Did you know?\"],XnGvPC:[\"Regardless of who you are, mastering even just one more skill on Khan Academy results in learning gains.\"],I4wbpi:[\"Learners have spent \",[\"actualMinutes\"],\" billion minutes learning on Khan Academy. \",[\"approxMinutes\"],\" billion minutes is equivalent to \",[\"actualYears\"],\" years.\"],\"+ZEIt5\":[\"You do not have permission to view this content\"],YBjfGp:[\"https://support.khanacademy.org/hc/en-us/articles/17921365165581\"],\"7p5kLi\":[\"Dashboard\"],K30plV:[\"Free Online Courses, Lessons & Practice\"],\"0gAPTG\":[\"Learn for free about math, art, computer programming, economics, physics, chemistry, biology, medicine, finance, history, and more. Khan Academy is a nonprofit with the mission of providing a free, world-class education for anyone, anywhere.\"],\"75iTY6\":[\"(opens in a new tab)\"],nDvpdh:[\"Footer navigation\"],ypDN2U:[\"Khan Academy is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. Please <0>support us</0> today.\"],OR0Xo8:[\"Districts\"],mUlANZ:[\"School systems\"],lMeXew:[\"Khan Academy Districts\"],\"3Su2jA\":[\"Khan Academy School Systems\"],fTO9Ko:[\"Khan Kids for Schools\"],\"y+Q0YW\":[\"Teachers\"],bwMx8L:[\"Khan Academy for Teachers\"],ucgZ0o:[\"Organization\"],\"+mNwru\":[\"About us\"],HyFz7F:[\"Leadership\"],\"3JSu/M\":[\"Supporters\"],\"astDB+\":[\"Blog\"],\"8gFN3i\":[\"Get involved\"],\"44LQXB\":[\"Giving\"],fK7YOw:[\"Downloads\"],\"4Y5H+g\":[\"Terms\"],\"rjGI/Q\":[\"Privacy\"],AnNF5e:[\"Accessibility\"],\"QQfZy/\":[\"Follow us on LinkedIn\"],UBhTf2:[\"Follow us on YouTube\"],uq5UqL:[\"Explore our courses\"],l8rp1O:[\"Math\"],FDUDaM:[\"Built for learning. Not for profit.\"],k2DZcM:[\"Khan Academy is a nonprofit with a simple mission: provide a free, world-class education for anyone, anywhere. Funded by donors and partners, we stay focused on what matters most—helping people learn.\"],K2tp3E:[\"Learn about our mission\"],iLlv6E:[\"Frequently asked questions, answered.\"],J0E6Rv:[\"Is Khan Academy really free?\"],KNjLTP:[\"Yes.\"],HEoyqV:[\"Khan Academy is always free for students, teachers, and families.\"],y85eJZ:[\"<0>District partnerships</0> build on that foundation with additional tools, insights, and support for an affordable price per student.\"],\"jGd/HY\":[\"<0>School system partnerships</0> build on that foundation with additional tools, insights, and support for an affordable price per student.\"],AnwCNP:[\"Do teachers already use Khan Academy?\"],zdvDgy:[\"Yes—millions of teachers already use Khan Academy in their classrooms.\"],\"hKkQ+o\":[\"Teachers use it to assign practice, track progress, and support students at different levels. Because it’s simple to start, many teachers are already familiar with it before a district-wide rollout.\"],kqK5jo:[\"How does Khan Academy support students at different levels?\"],pzBG8v:[\"Khan Academy helps students start where they are and move forward at their own pace.\"],\"6VeJXa\":[\"Students who need extra support can build foundational skills step by step, while students who are ready can continue advancing—so every learner makes progress.\"],coP7Wi:[\"Does Khan Academy actually improve learning outcomes?\"],tW3qiS:[\"Yes. Research shows that students who practice more skills on Khan Academy see greater academic gains.\"],\"Y4/YQo\":[\"Students in Khan Academy <0>district partnerships</0> are 6\\xd7 more likely to reach 60 or more skills to proficiency, which can result in a 30 percentage point gain on standardized tests.\"],swQTgf:[\"As students build skills over time, their progress compounds—helping them close gaps and reach proficiency.\"],ZewIYh:[\"How does Khan Academy support schools and districts?\"],h93LyN:[\"How does Khan Academy support school systems?\"],accp7y:[\"<0>District partnerships</0> provide additional tools and support to help schools implement Khan Academy at scale.\"],\"M8+BkJ\":[\"<0>School system partnerships</0> provide additional tools and support to help schools implement Khan Academy at scale.\"],\"1309Ua\":[\"This includes system-wide insights, implementation support, and professional learning to ensure teachers and students succeed.\"],\"O/gJlh\":[\"Free for every classroom. More for every district.\"],ZwmvxZ:[\"Free for every classroom. More for school systems.\"],T6uVjR:[\"For teachers, students, and families\"],\"9pAqNS\":[\"Khan Academy is free for teachers, students, and families. It includes everything needed to support learning in the classroom.\"],\"m/rqM/\":[\"High-quality content across all subjects\"],HRTroQ:[\"Practice and mastery-based learning\"],\"87DdAb\":[\"AI-powered assistant, Khanmigo, for teachers\"],h1DrEc:[\"Tools to assign work and track progress\"],ld2TGO:[\"50+ la