 be able to send you notifications and announcements about new stuff on Khan Academy. Don't worry though, we hate spam too, so we make it really easy to unsubscribe.\"],xUge7W:[\"Once you open the email we sent and finish signing up, you'll be able to receive other emails from Khan Academy.\"],Weq9zb:[\"General\"],nKa33r:[\"Occasionally we'll send you email that we think you'll appreciate. Here, you can manage whether or not you receive those messages.\"],\"4ZNWZM\":[\"Receive email from Khan Academy\"],YZV1Tb:[\"Note that you may still receive critical email such as forgotten password resets.\"],\"yUZ+im\":[\"Khan Academy District emails\"],jOXyjG:[\"Receive monthly progress reports for your district or school.\"],\"zF/WsE\":[\"Receive KAD Emails\"],e8HiVs:[\"Receive a summary of what your children have been working on:\"],l0yT8w:[\"Weekly activity reports\"],horr45:[\"Newsletters\"],\"2Y1H7h\":[\"Our newsletters keep you up-to-date with what's happening at Khan Academy.\"],jcfLIv:[\"Answer posted to your question\"],\"2m/dbB\":[\"New assignment notifications\"],\"Soccb+\":[\"Notifications related to streaks\"],\"3dPJgV\":[\"To use an email address not listed here, \",[\"connect\"],\".\"],VVqeHw:[\"connect a new email to your account\"],OC4BXW:[\"Primary email settings\"],H6yH9B:[\"Connect a new email to your account to make changes.\"],v7zFLx:[\"Send email to\"],\"SxS+dk\":[\"Resend email to \",[\"email\"]],G42SNI:[\"Resend email\"],JHLcvq:[\"Email sent!\"],VnIrAB:[\"Oops! We were unable to send you an email.\"],\"5X8QZ4\":[\"Try again?\"],sSDjMY:[\"Save changes to color settings\"],jZlrte:[\"Color\"],YBt9YP:[\"Beta\"],i2R6Qg:[\"Choose if Khan Academy's appearance should be light, dark, or follow your computer's settings.\"],tvmuQ0:[\"Color scheme\"],\"BKcp+k\":[\"An error occurred. Please try again.\"],\"4InpC7\":[\"Switch role\"],Nl04V5:[\"Choose a different role\"],\"U/KHKA\":[\"Sign up as a learner today!\"],AV8GzI:[\"First, we need your date of birth to help us give you the best experience!\"],hXzOVo:[\"Next\"],\"g/h0ep\":[\"Don’t have a Khan Academy account?\"],\"/c1mbC\":[\"Need a Khan Academy account?\"],\"1fGJxc\":[\"Sign up today\"],rBiFe3:[\"Sign up as a teacher\"],fbhmyS:[\"Join class as a learner\"],\"QHuZ+0\":[\"You must agree to the terms to proceed.\"],rQDh9K:[\"Use letters and numbers only. For safety, don't use your real name.\"],iQYkrR:[\"Or sign up with email\"],n9OeAN:[\"What is your parent or guardian's email?\"],v6x6lQ:[\"You'll need permission to use Khan Academy\"],khEQ02:[\"Choose a username\"],ZvwIbE:[\"How Khan Academy works\"],\"Www/DB\":[\"Real progress starts with <0>how</0> students learn.\"],oeugNy:[\"Students learn when they can practice consistently, get feedback right away, and get support when it matters most. Khan Academy makes that possible so students stay motivated and keep moving forward, no matter where they are in their learning.\"],\"bZY/ey\":[\"Practice builds understanding through standards-aligned skills\"],\"0iAWNA\":[\"AI tutor feedback keeps students moving when they get stuck\"],LIPac2:[\"Feedback keeps students moving when they get stuck\"],WKZy5I:[\"Teacher insights show what students need next\"],\"Vgx/fG\":[\"Learner results\"],HTWuer:[\"Every skill counts.\"],xIN7iU:[\"Each skill a student masters builds on the last, helping them close gaps, build confidence, and move forward, whether they’re catching up or advancing. That progress is measurable, and it adds up.\"],su9Cco:[\"1 skill mastered → +0.5 percentage points\"],ZCBD8k:[\"10 skills mastered → +5 percentage points\"],IeljfD:[\"60 skills mastered → +30 percentage points\"],sJXFtS:[\"See our impact\"],x0KJFe:[\"Strengthen every classroom.\"],bJfdNx:[\"From individual learners to entire school systems, Khan Academy helps learning happen.\"],gi64hR:[\"Looking for district pricing? <0>Talk to our team</0>\"],uw3RKa:[\"Schools & Districts\"],\"jwP0+M\":[\"Students\"],ub8C91:[\"Families\"],ArmsK1:[\"Benefits for students, teachers, and families\"],SOo5TX:[\"Drive progress across every classroom.\"],FXTQTY:[\"Khan Academy is already used by teachers every day. District partnerships build on that foundation, bringing consistency, visibility, and deeper learning across your system.\"],Otub3g:[\"Khan Academy is already used by teachers every day. System-level partnerships build on that foundation, bringing consistency, visibility, and deeper learning across schools.\"],ppPGqV:[\"Deepen learning with AI-powered support for students\"],\"7n1OIb\":[\"Build capacity with professional learning and implementation support\"],wwuroU:[\"Explore school system partnerships\"],gNSS33:[\"Talk to our team\"],otYBQr:[\"Reach every student in your classroom.\"],OYNgpx:[\"Great teaching starts with knowing where students are and what they need next. Khan Academy makes it easy to assign standards-aligned practice, track progress, and support every learner.\"],K8X2Ze:[\"Assign practice in minutes\"],qHb8LW:[\"See who’s stuck and why\"],\"Ka+Uto\":[\"Engage students in practice\"],xAM8rG:[\"Keep advanced learners moving\"],jWbnJC:[\"Teachers sign up free\"],fBU09J:[\"Explore teacher tools\"],qpmxy9:[\"Learn at your own pace. Build real skills.\"],\"9Ymb2d\":[\"Khan Academy starts where you are and keeps you moving forward. Practice step by step, get feedback, and build confidence as you learn.\"],ZGjoS1:[\"Practice across every subject with high-quality content\"],qgRzOI:[\"Get instant feedback and support\"],KlstoY:[\"Build skills step by step\"],\"8AqRht\":[\"Learn anytime, at your own pace\"],TxQe4o:[\"Start learning free\"],DMNtBi:[\"Explore Khan Academy Kids\"],maL15Q:[\"Support learning at home.\"],oAMooI:[\"When students can practice at home, learning compounds. Khan Academy gives families a simple way to support what students are learning in school.\"],\"c+KbhD\":[\"Reinforce classroom learning at home\"],A3SrG9:[\"Track progress and stay involved\"],\"u7/OTq\":[\"Build confidence through practice\"],\"E/hDyZ\":[\"Free and easy to get started\"],\"f9Q+3M\":[\"Families sign up free\"],Px8xfN:[\"Proof of our impact\"],E3yBSE:[\"<0>180M+</0><1>registered users</1>\"],Nhsem2:[\"<0>63B+</0><1>minutes of learning</1>\"],wzVtFh:[\"<0>Free</0><1>for learners and teachers</1>\"],UmJLzH:[\"<0>15+ years</0><1>focused on one mission</1>\"],yYZ4Bk:[\"“Khan Academy’s practice sets gave my students a quick but effective way to practice what we’d learned in class. It became our nightly practice—and a way for students to really own their learning.”\"],F0b9oz:[\"“Khan Academy’s practice sets, with just four to seven targeted questions per topic, gave my students a quick but effective way to practice what we’d learned in class. It became our nightly practice—and a way for students to really own their learning.”\"],\"//d6hk\":[\"Stories from our community.\"],\"+a2OkK\":[\"STATE DEPARTMENT\"],OMcP5N:[\"“One of our high schools in Providence was recognized for placing second in the nation for moving math skills to proficient with the help of Khan Academy Districts. This means so much. This is a school that had not experienced that kind of success before.”\"],WXrzhJ:[\"- Rhode Island Commissioner of Education\"],ioBUu0:[\"ADMINISTRATOR\"],\"/fPtKQ\":[\"“One of the benefits of Khan Academy is that whether students are reviewing or learning new content, Khanmigo is a personal tutor. If you practice math wrong, it can actually do damage. Khanmigo will not let students practice it wrong, so you know they’re getting good practice.”\"],SunHzk:[\"- Hanover Community School Corporation (IN) assistant superintendent\"],m6YjRo:[\"TEACHER\"],\"W+XOrm\":[\"- Tipp City, Ohio, eighth-grade math teacher\"],\"8UI9eU\":[\"“When instruction became more rigorous, students initially struggled, but that was an expected and important part of the learning process.”\"],R1yGxY:[\"- School system\"],z9jj9j:[\"- Administrator\"],\"0oC1zi\":[\"“Khan Academy wasn’t just an edtech program used at the school, it was part of the math culture.”\"],pzyWUL:[\"- Middle school teacher\"],G1wIvT:[\"FAMILIES\"],wwv4oJ:[\"“Khan Academy has become part of our nightly routine. I signed up this fall to track my kids’ learning, and it’s been a game changer.”\"],\"3Z/cGP\":[\"- Parent\"],\"+bWrXJ\":[\"Play video: a student describes learning on Khan Academy\"],XZnExt:[\"“This is like the most fun I’ve had on a learning website in a long time.”\"],gWOgjr:[\"What learning looks like in practice\"],io0yl1:[\"Video: a student describes learning on Khan Academy\"],\"/+PQ0p\":[\"My Favorites\"],GdgCoi:[\"Plan\"],hYgDIe:[\"Create\"],aBVFl3:[\"Differentiate\"],XYLcNv:[\"Support\"],rjZpLn:[\"Learn\"],g20SMS:[\"All Tools\"],nuwdKq:[\"Blooket Generator\"],\"Nj+Ngg\":[\"Create Blooket questions on a variety of topics.\"],\"CS/SbE\":[\"Chunk Text\"],tMBxOA:[\"Break complex texts into manageable sections for easier student comprehension.\"],vbmUWQ:[\"Class Newsletter\"],W50dNO:[\"Produce engaging newsletters to keep parents informed about class activities.\"],EBVjqh:[\"Class Snapshot\"],\"3gVo6T\":[\"Review your students' performance and trends.\"],STbjD9:[\"Clear Directions\"],\"Ga7ky/\":[\"Generate concise, easy-to-follow instructions for assignments and activities.\"],qBRiWp:[\"Discussion Prompts\"],\"8/3TIn\":[\"Craft engaging prompts to stimulate meaningful classroom discussions.\"],aCVoMU:[\"Exit Ticket\"],\"3/zyuh\":[\"Create quick end-of-lesson assessments to check student understanding.\"],lurblM:[\"Fun Class Summary Poem\"],\"l9/Eie\":[\"Transform memorable class moments into a creative poetic recap.\"],L2iOam:[\"IEP Assistant\"],ATszcS:[\"Streamline the creation of Individualized Education Plans.\"],raPyFk:[\"Note: This output is a draft and does not constitute a complete or final IEP. It requires further refinement based on your professional judgment, evaluation, and analysis. Be sure that the final IEP is tailored to the student's specific needs and complies with all applicable school