            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"contentJson\":\"{\\\"componentProps\\\":{\\\"curation\\\":{\\\"ancestorTopics\\\":[],\\\"attribution\\\":null,\\\"breadcrumbs\\\":[],\\\"curationKind\\\":\\\"Domain\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Aprenda a codificar programas de computador, a projetar algoritmos que tornam os computadores mais eficientes e descubra como é uma carreira profissional na computação.\\\",\\\"domain\\\":\\\"computing\\\",\\\"domainId\\\":\\\"x45aed616\\\",\\\"initialTabUrl\\\":\\\"/computing?lang=pt\\\",\\\"isUnlisted\\\":false,\\\"renderedPath\\\":\\\"computing\\\",\\\"requestedPath\\\":\\\"computing\\\",\\\"searchSchema\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"tabs\\\":[{\\\"modules\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"TableOfContentsRow\\\",\\\"subjectMasteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"topicId\\\":\\\"xffde7c31\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Neste curso, você explorará as maravilhas que você pode criar com a programação. Aprenda a programar desenhos, animações e jogos usando JavaScript e a biblioteca Processing, e explore as tecnologias por trás da web conforme você projeta páginas com HTML e CSS.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/genfiles/topic-icons/icons/programming.png-e13016-128c.png\\\",\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Introdução a JavaScript: Desenho \\\\u0026 Animação\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/programming\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Introdução a HTML/CSS: criação de páginas Web\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/html-css\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Introdução a SQL: Consulta e gerenciamento de dados\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/sql\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"JavaScript Avançado: Jogos \\\\u0026 Visualizações\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"JS avançado: Simulações Naturais\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-natural-simulations\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"HTML/JS: tornando páginas web interativas\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/html-css-js\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"HTML/JS: tornando páginas web interativas com jQuery\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Conheça o profissional\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming/meet-the-computing-professional-unit\\\"}],\\\"masteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"masteryPointsAvailable\\\":0,\\\"rowIndex\\\":0,\\\"rowsTotal\\\":4,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"computer-programming\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Programação de computadores - JavaScript e a web\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-programming\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"TableOfContentsRow\\\",\\\"subjectMasteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"topicId\\\":\\\"x301707a0\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Aprenda tópicos selecionados da ciência da computação - algoritmos (como resolvemos problemas comuns em ciência da computação e medimos a eficiência das nossas soluções), criptografia (como protegemos informações secretas), e teoria da informação (como codificamos e comprimimos informações).\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/genfiles/topic-icons/icons/information_theory.png-60d575-128c.png\\\",\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Algoritmos\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-science/algorithms\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Criptografia\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-science/cryptography\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Teoria da Informação\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-science/informationtheory\\\"}],\\\"masteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"masteryPointsAvailable\\\":0,\\\"rowIndex\\\":1,\\\"rowsTotal\\\":4,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"computer-science\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Teoria da Ciência da Computação\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/computer-science\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"TableOfContentsRow\\\",\\\"subjectMasteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"topicId\\\":\\\"x54f76d4b\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Só tem uma hora? Aprenda os conceitos básicos de programação, a criar páginas web ou a criar bancos de dados.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/genfiles/topic-icons/icons/computing_orange.png-653676-128c.png\\\",\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Aulas da Hora do Código\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/hour-of-code/hour-of-code-lessons\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Recursos adicionais\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/hour-of-code/hour-of-code-resources\\\"}],\\\"masteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"masteryPointsAvailable\\\":0,\\\"rowIndex\\\":2,\\\"rowsTotal\\\":4,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"hour-of-code\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Hora do Código\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/hour-of-code\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"TableOfContentsRow\\\",\\\"subjectMasteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"topicId\\\":\\\"x5279a44ae0ab15d6\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Use a programação como uma ferramenta para modelar doenças infecciosas, criar níveis de jogo e muito mais! Comece com os fundamentos do Python como variáveis, condicionais, laços e funções, enquanto você constrói um portfólio de projetos que mostram algumas das maneiras excitantes que você pode aplicar a programação a problemas do mundo real.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/genfiles/topic-icons/icons/intro-to-python-fundamentals.png-82aa5f-128c.png\\\",\\\"links\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Pensamento computacional com variáveis\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:computational-thinking-with-variables\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Projetando algoritmos com condicionais\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:designing-algorithms-with-conditionals\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Simulando fenômenos com laços\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:simulating-phenomena-with-loops\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Brincando com funções\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:playing-games-with-functions\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Automatizando tarefas com listas\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:automating-tasks-with-lists\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Analisando dados com dicionários\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:analyzing-data-with-dictionaries\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Recursos para professores\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals/x5279a44ae0ab15d6:teacher-resources\\\"}],\\\"masteryEnabled\\\":false,\\\"masteryPointsAvailable\\\":0,\\\"rowIndex\\\":3,\\\"rowsTotal\\\":4,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"intro-to-python-fundamentals\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Introdução à Ciência da Computação - Python\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"/computing/intro-to-python-fundamentals\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"TabFooter\\\",\\\"showCommunityQuestions\\\":false,\\\"communityQuestionsUrl\\\":\\\"/computing/d\\\"}]}],\\\"translatedCustomTitleTag\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Computação\\\"}}}\"}}"
